{"outcome":"ok","data":{"query":"balancing service provider update balancing energy bid after gate closure","retriever":"hybrid+ce","answerable_score":null,"articles":[{"id":"reg_2017_2195_art24","act":"Commission Regulation (EU) 2017/2195 (electricity balancing guideline)","article":"24","heading":"Balancing energy gate closure time","url":"https://publications.europa.eu/resource/celex/02017R2195-20220619","version":"consolidated version of 2022-06-19","text":"# Commission Regulation (EU) 2017/2195 (electricity balancing guideline), Article 24: Balancing energy gate closure time

