(59) ‘small connected system’ means small connected system as defined in point (43) of Article 2 of Directive (EU) 2019/944;

(60) ‘ancillary service’ means ancillary service as defined in point (48) of Article 2 of Directive (EU) 2019/944;

(61) ‘non-frequency ancillary service’ means non-frequency ancillary service as defined in point (49) of Article 2 of Directive (EU) 2019/944;

