That level shall be jointly analysed and defined by all transmission system operators in a capacity calculation region for each individual bidding zone border, and shall be subject to the approval of all regulatory authorities in the capacity calculation region."},{"id":"reg_2019_943_art7","act":"Regulation (EU) 2019/943 (electricity market regulation)","article":"7","heading":"Day-ahead and intraday markets","url":"https://publications.europa.eu/resource/celex/02019R0943-20240716","version":"consolidated version of 2024-07-16","text":"# Regulation (EU) 2019/943 (electricity market regulation), Article 7: Day-ahead and intraday markets

