(a) calculate and monitor the FRCE of the whole LFC block; and

(b) take the FRCE of the whole LFC block into account for the calculation of the setpoint value for aFRR activation in accordance with Article 143(3) in addition to the FRCE of its LFC area."},{"id":"reg_2017_2195_art21","act":"Commission Regulation (EU) 2017/2195 (electricity balancing guideline)","article":"21","heading":"European platform for the exchange of balancing energy from frequency restoration reserves with automatic activation","url":"https://publications.europa.eu/resource/celex/02017R2195-20220619","version":"consolidated version of 2022-06-19","text":"# Commission Regulation (EU) 2017/2195 (electricity balancing guideline), Article 21: European platform for the exchange of balancing energy from frequency restoration reserves with automatic activation

