{"outcome":"ok","data":{"query":""low-frequency demand disconnection" "2016/1281" seconds","retriever":"hybrid+ce","answerable_score":null,"articles":[{"id":"reg_2017_1485_art157","act":"Commission Regulation (EU) 2017/1485 (system operation guideline)","article":"157","heading":"FRR dimensioning","url":"https://publications.europa.eu/resource/celex/02017R1485-20210315","version":"consolidated version of 2021-03-15","text":"# Commission Regulation (EU) 2017/1485 (system operation guideline), Article 157: FRR dimensioning

1. All TSOs of a LFC Block shall set out FRR dimensioning rules in the LFC Block operational agreement.

