5. Member States that apply capacity mechanisms on 4 July 2019 shall adapt their mechanisms to comply with Chapter 4 without prejudice to commitments or contracts concluded by 31 December 2019."},{"id":"dir_2019_944_art40","act":"Directive (EU) 2019/944 (internal market for electricity)","article":"40","heading":"Tasks of transmission system operators","url":"https://publications.europa.eu/resource/celex/02019L0944-20251012","version":"consolidated version of 2025-10-12","text":"# Directive (EU) 2019/944 (internal market for electricity), Article 40: Tasks of transmission system operators

